    "applies -- no bearer token required.",
    "No RED params exist, so no VTC/ATC cases apply; coverage instead verifies (a) a freshly",
    "seeded vet with a specialty link, (b) a freshly seeded vet with none, and (c) the always-",
    "present static reference vet (id=2, Helen Leary/radiology) from data.sql, to pin down both",
    "dynamic and static response content precisely."
  ],
  "seedParams": [
    {"name": "SEQ1", "kind": "seq", "offset": 0},
    {"name": "SEQ2", "kind": "seq", "offset": 1}
  ],
  "auth": {"pattern": "none"},
  "fixtures": {
    "setup": [
      {"table": "vets", "values": {"id": {"ref": "SEQ1"}, "first_name": "SeedSpec", "last_name": "ZzzSeedSpecialtyVet1"}},
      {"table": "vets", "values": {"id": {"ref": "SEQ2"}, "first_name": "SeedNoSpec", "last_name": "ZzzSeedNoSpecialtyVet2"}},
